* email address;
* username;
* password and related authentication data;
* account status and account settings; and
* records relating to verification, account protection, or account recovery.

### 3.2 Conversation and content data

Because Solara AI is a conversation-based AI service, we may collect and store:

* prompts, messages, instructions, questions, and requests you submit;
* code, text, files, or other content you upload or send;
* generated outputs and responses;
* conversation history;
* timestamps and request metadata; and
