### 3.4 Technical and usage data

When you use the Service, we may automatically collect technical and usage information such as:

* IP address;
* browser type and version;
* operating system;
* device type;
* session information;
* timestamps;
* approximate location derived from IP address;
* crash logs, diagnostics, and error reports;
