Solara AI allows open-ended inputs. That means you may choose to disclose personal data about yourself or others in conversations.

If you do so:

* that content may be stored as part of your conversation history;
* it may be processed to generate the response you requested;
* it may be reviewed when reasonably necessary for support, abuse prevention, security, legal compliance, or enforcing the Terms of Service; and
